Package: ikdds.dashboard
Title: IKDDS Haemodialysis Audit Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Conor", "Judge", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "conor.judge@hse.ie"),
    person("Michelle", "Costello", role = "ctb"))
Description: Interactive Shiny dashboard for the Irish Kidney Disease Data
    System (IKDDS) annual haemodialysis audit. Provides 14 pages covering
    23 clinical metrics across 7 domains (demographics, PRD, dialysis
    adequacy, blood pressure, biochemistry, anaemia, vascular access) as
    caterpillar plots, funnel plots, centre profiles, individual patient QA,
    and drill-down tables. Supports both synthetic demo data and live REDCap
    data sources.
